In men's, the suit dominates with vest and plastron, but cream-colored or brown combinations can also be chosen.
It is important to select the restaurant, it was explained.
Unadorned adjoining rooms are not optimal, the ambience should be special.
Here the domain drew attention to its own offer in the draw.
If you want to come forward with the carriage, Uwe Link has an offer for you.
"Carriages are also popular for bachelorette parties," he says.
Romance is also in demand for invitation cards, flower arrangements and also for wedding pictures.
More and more in vogue comes the "after-wedding photo" - i.e. recording series in special places, preferably waterfalls, a few days after the festival, but in wedding clothes, Elisabeth Keidel explained.
Many more details of a successful wedding were presented in the domain on Sunday.
Floral arrangement, rings, wedding table, cakes and also a magician, such as Marko Ripperger, who can entertain guests in style.
Don't forget the right cosmetics and nail care.
Everything for an unforgettable celebration.
